      <h4 class="blog-title" style="font-size:28px; color: #0d47a1;"><strong>Govind Thangwal</strong></h4>
      <h5><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 128);"><strong>11th November 2025</strong></span></h5>
      <p style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #000;">
        I have cleared my NISM 19 C AIF fund manager exam through their modules and their live classes. So it helped me a lot in terms of caselets where there are many case studies and they explained very well in their live classes and through that I was able to clear my NISM 19 C exam.<br>
       <br><em> Fund Manager - Greater Noida </em>
      </p>

